Package: iconifyr
Title: Access the Iconify Icon API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Noah", "Weidig", , "weidignc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download, search and embed icons from the Iconify
    <https://iconify.design> API, including self-hosted instances.
    Retrieve SVG icons, list icon sets and their licenses, and render
    icons as inline HTML or PNG.
